# Who reviews agent configuration (@rydncn). GitHub then asks them to review any pull request that
# touches these files. Required review needs branch protection; without it
# (GitHub Free with a private repository), this still requests the review,
# and the CI step "Agent configuration changes" flags the pull request.
#
# Agent configuration is code (rule 18 in the ai-playbook): hooks run on
# every session, settings change what the agent may do without asking, MCP
# servers reach other systems, and CLAUDE.md and the rules are instructions.

/.claude/                @rydncn
/.mcp.json               @rydncn
CLAUDE.md                @rydncn
AGENTS.md                @rydncn
/.github/workflows/      @rydncn
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @rydncn
/.devcontainer/          @rydncn
